            "@id": "https://blaksyd.com/founders/sindhuu-devarakonda/#person"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What are the four pillars of Blaksyd?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The four pillars of Blaksyd are Blak, Persona, Minit, and Nexus. This is how Blaksyd builds meaningful conversations: with AI, with yourself, with real people, and with communities."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is Minit therapy?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "No. Minit is not therapy. It is Blaksyd's trained human listening layer for private conversation and support."
